cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its Decider gate pattern, please cite it as below."
title: "Agentic AWS DeepRacer on strands-robots"
abstract: >-
  A stock AWS DeepRacer driven by strands-robots over ROS 2 (rosbridge). A Strands Agents
  loop on Amazon Bedrock turns spoken or typed instructions into bounded movements; before
  every motor command a local Strands Decider 2B judges the command against the briefed
  envelope and the live camera frame and maps its answers to the Strands interventions
  Proceed, Guide, Confirm and Deny. Strands Bidi gives the rover a push-to-talk voice through
  Amazon Nova Sonic; a Strands Harness race engineer services the car under a Cedar policy.
  Physics stops the car; the decider explains.
